## The 4-Phase Q4 UGC Creative Roadmap

To dominate Q4 without burning your margins on exorbitant CPMs, structure your campaign timeline across four distinct phases:

| Phase | Timeline | Core Objective | Key Creative Format |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Phase 1: Angle Validation** | Sep 15 - Oct 31 | Test 20-30 distinct hooks & creative concepts at low spend | AI UGC test variations with broad audiences |
| **Phase 2: VIP Early Bird** | Nov 01 - Nov 20 | Warm up pixels and build massive SMS/Email waitlists | "Don't wait for BFCM" insider pass ads |
| **Phase 3: The BFCM Blitz** | Nov 21 - Dec 02 | Aggressive spend on proven winners with urgency overlays | Flash sale countdowns, bundle unboxings |
| **Phase 4: Last-Minute Gifting** | Dec 03 - Dec 24 | Capture late shoppers and shipping deadline urgency | "Will arrive before Dec 24" proof ads |

