## High-Converting BFCM Video Script Blueprint (45 Seconds)

Here is an exact script framework engineered for maximum holiday conversion velocity:

```text
[0:00 - 0:03] THE HOOK (Visual: Creator pointing at giant package on doorstep)
Voiceover: "I promised myself I wouldn't go crazy this Black Friday, but when I saw this bundle was 60% off, I couldn't resist."

[0:03 - 0:12] THE PROBLEM & GIFTING PAIN POINT (Visual: Fast B-roll of stressed holiday shopping)
Voiceover: "Every year I waste hours searching for unique gifts that look luxury without breaking my budget. Everything online is either cheap plastic or insanely overpriced."

[0:12 - 0:28] THE DEMO & UNBOXING REVEAL (Visual: Dynamic macro product reveal & hands-on usage)
Voiceover: "Look at the build quality on this. The finish is solid aerospace aluminum, and it works straight out of the box in 10 seconds. My brother saw mine and literally asked if he could keep it."

[0:28 - 0:38] THE EXCLUSIVE DEAL MATH (Visual: Side-by-side pricing graphic with countdown timer)
Voiceover: "During normal months this kit retails for $120. Right now for Black Friday, you get the entire set, 2 accessories, and free priority shipping for just $49."

[0:38 - 0:45] URGENT CALL TO ACTION (Visual: Creator tapping the screen link)
Voiceover: "Tap the shop link below to grab the holiday bundle before the seasonal inventory runs out."
```

